'''Hanna Smith''' was one of the guests invited to an upcoming dinner for the governor of [[Hanna City|Hanna]], hosted by [[Senator]] [[Mon Mothma]] and her husband [[Perrin Fertha]].<ref name="Aldhani">{{Andor|Aldhani (episode)}}</ref>

==Appearances==
*{{Andor|Aldhani (episode)}} {{1stm}} {{C|Mentioned on [[datapad]] only}}

==Behind the scenes==
The character's name<ref name="Aldhani" /> is similar to [[Hannah Meredith-Smith]], who worked as an art department coordinator on the television series ''[[Star Wars: Andor]]'',<ref name="Kassa">{{Andor|Kassa (episode)}}</ref> where the character's name appears.<ref name="Aldhani" />

